<li data-start=3D"7473" data-end=3D"7645" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7476" data-end=3D"7645" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
476" data-end=3D"7516">Utilisez des composants fonctionnels</strong> : Les =
