<h2 data-start=3D"5598" data-end=3D"5674" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5601" data-end=3D"5674">7. L=E2=80=99=C3=89tat dans un Cycle de Vie : Compr=
endre le comportement des =C3=89tats</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"5676" data-end=3D"5745" class=3D"">L'=C3=A9tat joue un r=
=C3=B4le crucial dans le <strong data-start=3D"5712" data-end=3D"5728">cycl=
e de vie</strong> des composants.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5747" data-end=3D"5804" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5751" data-end=3D"5804">7.1. Cycle de vie dans les composants de classe :</=
strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5806" data-end=3D"6194">
<li data-start=3D"5806" data-end=3D"5942" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5808" data-end=3D"5942" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
808" data-end=3D"5833"><code data-start=3D"5810" data-end=3D"5831">componen=
tDidMount()</code></strong> : Apr=C3=A8s le premier rendu du composant, vou=
s pouvez initialiser ou r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer des donn=C3=A9es (ex : requ=C3=
=AAtes API).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5943" data-end=3D"6056" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5945" data-end=3D"6056" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
945" data-end=3D"5971"><code data-start=3D"5947" data-end=3D"5969">componen=
tDidUpdate()</code></strong> : =C3=80 chaque mise =C3=A0 jour de l'=C3=A9ta=
t, ce cycle vous permet d=E2=80=99agir lorsque l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat change.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6057" data-end=3D"6194" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6059" data-end=3D"6194" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
059" data-end=3D"6087"><code data-start=3D"6061" data-end=3D"6085">componen=
tWillUnmount()</code></strong> : Avant que le composant ne soit retir=C3=A9=
, pour nettoyer des ressources comme des abonnements ou des timers.</p>
</li>
</ul>
