<h3 data-start=3D"5722" data-end=3D"5751" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5726" data-end=3D"5751">Conclusion sur l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5753" data-end=3D"5938">
<li data-start=3D"5753" data-end=3D"5834" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5755" data-end=3D"5834" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"5759" data-end=3D"5786">composants fonctionnels</strong> utilisent le h=
ook <code data-start=3D"5805" data-end=3D"5815">useState</code> pour g=C3=
=A9rer l'=C3=A9tat.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5835" data-end=3D"5938" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5837" data-end=3D"5938" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"5841" data-end=3D"5877">composants bas=C3=A9s sur des classes</strong> =
utilisent <code data-start=3D"5888" data-end=3D"5900">this.state</code> et =
<code data-start=3D"5904" data-end=3D"5919">this.setState</code> pour g=C3=
=A9rer l'=C3=A9tat.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"5940" data-end=3D"6075" class=3D"">Avec l'introduction des=
 hooks, la gestion de l'=C3=A9tat est devenue beaucoup plus simple et plus =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9gante dans les composants fonctionnels.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6077" data-end=3D"6080" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6082" data-end=3D"6119" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6085" data-end=3D"6119">4. Cycle de vie des composants</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6121" data-end=3D"6162" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6125" data-end=3D"6162">4.1 Cycle de vie dans les classes</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6164" data-end=3D"6362" class=3D"">Les composants bas=C3=
=A9s sur des classes ont des m=C3=A9thodes de cycle de vie qui permettent d=
=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cuter des actions sp=C3=A9cifiques =C3=A0 diff=C3=A9rents =
moments de la vie d=E2=80=99un composant. Les principales m=C3=A9thodes son=
t :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6599">
<li data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6437" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6366" data-end=3D"6437" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
366" data-end=3D"6391"><code data-start=3D"6368" data-end=3D"6389">componen=
tDidMount()</code></strong> : Appel=C3=A9e apr=C3=A8s que le composant a =
=C3=A9t=C3=A9 mont=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6438" data-end=3D"6512" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6440" data-end=3D"6512" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
440" data-end=3D"6466"><code data-start=3D"6442" data-end=3D"6464">componen=
tDidUpdate()</code></strong> : Appel=C3=A9e apr=C3=A8s une mise =C3=A0 jour=
 du composant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6513" data-end=3D"6599" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6515" data-end=3D"6599" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
515" data-end=3D"6543"><code data-start=3D"6517" data-end=3D"6541">componen=
tWillUnmount()</code></strong> : Appel=C3=A9e juste avant que le composant =
ne soit d=C3=A9mont=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
