<h3 data-start=3D"7568" data-end=3D"7606" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7572" data-end=3D"7606">Conclusion sur le cycle de vie</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7608" data-end=3D"7812">
<li data-start=3D"7608" data-end=3D"7715" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7610" data-end=3D"7715" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"7614" data-end=3D"7638">composants de classe</strong> utilisent des m=
=C3=A9thodes comme <code data-start=3D"7668" data-end=3D"7687">componentDid=
Mount</code>, <code data-start=3D"7689" data-end=3D"7709">componentDidUpdat=
e</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7716" data-end=3D"7812" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7718" data-end=3D"7812" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"7722" data-end=3D"7749">composants fonctionnels</strong> utilisent le h=
ook <code data-start=3D"7768" data-end=3D"7781">useEffect()</code> pour g=
=C3=A9rer les effets de bord.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7814" data-end=3D"7817" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7819" data-end=3D"7887" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7822" data-end=3D"7887">5. Hooks : L'impact des hooks sur les composants fo=
nctionnels</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"7889" data-end=3D"8079" class=3D"">Les hooks ont r=C3=A9vo=
lutionn=C3=A9 les composants fonctionnels en apportant la possibilit=C3=A9 =
de g=C3=A9rer l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat et les effets de bord, ce qui =C3=A9tait =
autrefois limit=C3=A9 aux composants bas=C3=A9s sur des classes.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"8081" data-end=3D"8116" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8085" data-end=3D"8116">Quelques hooks importants :</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8117" data-end=3D"8458">
<li data-start=3D"8117" data-end=3D"8192" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8119" data-end=3D"8192" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
119" data-end=3D"8133"><code data-start=3D"8121" data-end=3D"8131">useState=
</code></strong> : Permet de g=C3=A9rer l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat dans les compos=
ants fonctionnels.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8193" data-end=3D"8288" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8195" data-end=3D"8288" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
195" data-end=3D"8210"><code data-start=3D"8197" data-end=3D"8208">useEffec=
t</code></strong> : Permet de g=C3=A9rer les effets de bord (ex. : les appe=
ls API, les abonnements).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8289" data-end=3D"8349" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8291" data-end=3D"8349" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
291" data-end=3D"8307"><code data-start=3D"8293" data-end=3D"8305">useConte=
xt</code></strong> : Permet de consommer un contexte global.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8350" data-end=3D"8458" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8352" data-end=3D"8458" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
352" data-end=3D"8368"><code data-start=3D"8354" data-end=3D"8366">useReduc=
er</code></strong> : Pour la gestion complexe de l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat, simil=
aire =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"8419" data-end=3D"8429">useState</code>, ma=
is avec plus de contr=C3=B4le.</p>
</li>
</ul>
