<li data-start=3D"3801" data-end=3D"3877" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3803" data-end=3D"3877" class=3D"">Le second =C3=A9l=C3=A9=
ment est une <strong data-start=3D"3829" data-end=3D"3841">fonction</strong=
> qui permet de mettre =C3=A0 jour l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat.</p>
