" data-end=3D"858">Migration vers un composant fonctionnel</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"862" data-end=3D"948">
<li data-start=3D"862" data-end=3D"901" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"864" data-end=3D"901" class=3D"">Comment migrer l'=C3=A9ta=
t avec <code data-start=3D"891" data-end=3D"901">useState</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"905" data-end=3D"948" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"907" data-end=3D"948" class=3D"">G=C3=A9rer les effets de =
bord avec <code data-start=3D"937" data-end=3D"948">useEffect</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"949" data-end=3D"1134" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"952" data-end=3D"1016" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"95=
2" data-end=3D"1016">Utilisation de hooks pour g=C3=A9rer des fonctionnalit=
=C3=A9s avanc=C3=A9es</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1020" data-end=3D"1134">
<li data-start=3D"1020" data-end=3D"1134" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1022" data-end=3D"1134" class=3D"">Migration de la gestion=
 du cycle de vie (avec <code data-start=3D"1068" data-end=3D"1087">componen=
tDidMount</code>, <code data-start=3D"1089" data-end=3D"1109">componentDidU=
pdate</code>, <code data-start=3D"1111" data-end=3D"1133">componentWillUnmo=
unt</code>)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1135" data-end=3D"1246" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1138" data-end=3D"1198" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
138" data-end=3D"1198">Bonnes pratiques et pi=C3=A8ges =C3=A0 =C3=A9viter l=
ors de la migration</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1202" data-end=3D"1246">
<li data-start=3D"1202" data-end=3D"1246" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1204" data-end=3D"1246" class=3D"">Conseils pour =C3=A9vit=
er les erreurs courantes</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1247" data-end=3D"1264" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1250" data-end=3D"1264" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
250" data-end=3D"1264">Conclusion</strong></p>
</li>
