te</code></strong> est utilis=C3=A9 pour stocker l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat (<code=
 data-start=3D"3952" data-end=3D"3959">count</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3962" data-end=3D"4069" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3964" data-end=3D"4069" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
964" data-end=3D"3989"><code data-start=3D"3966" data-end=3D"3987">componen=
tDidMount()</code></strong> est une m=C3=A9thode du cycle de vie appel=C3=
=A9e une fois apr=C3=A8s le montage du composant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4070" data-end=3D"4175" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4072" data-end=3D"4175" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
