<p data-start=3D"2724" data-end=3D"2845" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
724" data-end=3D"2755">Acc=C3=A9der aux =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments du DOM</strong> =
pour manipuler leur comportement, comme obtenir la taille d'un =C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ment ou g=C3=A9rer le focus.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2846" data-end=3D"3050" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2848" data-end=3D"3050" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
