data-start=3D"3338" data-end=3D"3348">useState</code> d=C3=A9clenche un nou=
veau rendu lorsque la valeur est modifi=C3=A9e, tandis que <code data-start=
=3D"3419" data-end=3D"3427">useRef</code> ne provoque pas de re-rendu.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3458" data-end=3D"3639">
<li data-start=3D"3458" data-end=3D"3558" class=3D"">
