></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6211" data-end=3D"6587">
<li data-start=3D"6211" data-end=3D"6312" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6213" data-end=3D"6312" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
213" data-end=3D"6229"><code data-start=3D"6215" data-end=3D"6227">useHisto=
ry</code></strong> : Permet de manipuler l'historique de navigation, de red=
iriger l'utilisateur, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6313" data-end=3D"6413" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6315" data-end=3D"6413" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
315" data-end=3D"6332"><code data-start=3D"6317" data-end=3D"6330">useLocat=
ion</code></strong> : Permet d'obtenir l'emplacement actuel dans l'applicat=
ion (par exemple, l'URL).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6414" data-end=3D"6502" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6416" data-end=3D"6502" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
416" data-end=3D"6431"><code data-start=3D"6418" data-end=3D"6429">useParam=
s</code></strong> : Permet d'acc=C3=A9der aux param=C3=A8tres de l'URL dans=
 les routes dynamiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6503" data-end=3D"6587" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6505" data-end=3D"6587" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
505" data-end=3D"6524"><code data-start=3D"6507" data-end=3D"6522">useRoute=
Match</code></strong> : Permet de r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer des informations sur =
une route actuelle.</p>
</li>
</ul>
