<h3 data-start=3D"4179" data-end=3D"4210" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4183" data-end=3D"4210">2.2 Explication du Code</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4212" data-end=3D"4726">
<li data-start=3D"4212" data-end=3D"4334" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4214" data-end=3D"4334" class=3D"">La route principale <co=
de data-start=3D"4234" data-end=3D"4246">/dashboard</code> rend le composan=
t <code data-start=3D"4265" data-end=3D"4276">Dashboard</code> qui contient=
 un menu avec des liens vers ses sous-routes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4335" data-end=3D"4489" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4489" class=3D"">Les sous-routes sont d=
=C3=A9finies =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99int=C3=A9rieur de la route <code data-start=
=3D"4393" data-end=3D"4404">Dashboard</code> avec <code data-start=3D"4410"=
 data-end=3D"4420">&lt;Routes&gt;</code> imbriqu=C3=A9 et <code data-start=
=3D"4433" data-end=3D"4442">&lt;Route&gt;</code> pour chaque vue (overview,=
 settings, profile).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4490" data-end=3D"4623" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4492" data-end=3D"4623" class=3D"">Le chemin <code data-st=
art=3D"4502" data-end=3D"4519">path=3D"overview"</code> est relatif =C3=A0 =
la route parente <code data-start=3D"4551" data-end=3D"4563">/dashboard</co=
de>, et c=E2=80=99est ce qui rend la structure imbriqu=C3=A9e fonctionnelle=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4624" data-end=3D"4726" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4626" data-end=3D"4726" class=3D"">L'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment <co=
de data-start=3D"4636" data-end=3D"4661">element=3D{&lt;Component /&gt;}</c=
ode> est utilis=C3=A9 pour rendre les composants associ=C3=A9s aux sous-rou=
tes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4728" data-end=3D"4731" class=3D"">
