<li data-start=3D"1147" data-end=3D"1264" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1149" data-end=3D"1264" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
149" data-end=3D"1166">=C3=89tat immuable</strong> : Les mises =C3=A0 jour =
se font en cr=C3=A9ant de nouveaux objets d=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat plut=C3=B4t q=
u=E2=80=99en modifiant l=E2=80=99existant.</p>
