<hr data-start=3D"5136" data-end=3D"5139" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5141" data-end=3D"5180" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5144" data-end=3D"5180">4. Le Flux de Donn=C3=A9es dans Redux</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"5181" data-end=3D"5236" class=3D"">Le flux de donn=C3=A9es=
 suit un <strong data-start=3D"5208" data-end=3D"5234">sch=C3=A9ma unidirec=
tionnel</strong> :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5237" data-end=3D"5575">
<li data-start=3D"5237" data-end=3D"5299" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5240" data-end=3D"5299" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99utilisateur e=
ffectue une action (ex. clic sur un bouton).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5300" data-end=3D"5361" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5303" data-end=3D"5361" class=3D"">Le composant <strong da=
ta-start=3D"5316" data-end=3D"5328">dispatch</strong> une action (<code dat=
a-start=3D"5341" data-end=3D"5359">dispatch(action)</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5362" data-end=3D"5409" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5365" data-end=3D"5409" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99action est in=
tercept=C3=A9e par le <strong data-start=3D"5397" data-end=3D"5408">reducer=
</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5410" data-end=3D"5495" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5413" data-end=3D"5495" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"5416" data-end=3D"5427">reducer</strong> met =C3=A0 jour l=E2=80=99=C3=
=A9tat et Redux stocke ce nouvel =C3=A9tat dans le <strong data-start=3D"54=
85" data-end=3D"5494">store</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5496" data-end=3D"5575" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5499" data-end=3D"5575" class=3D"">Les composants React =
=C3=A9coutent le <strong data-start=3D"5532" data-end=3D"5541">store</stron=
g> et mettent =C3=A0 jour leur affichage.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5577" data-end=3D"5580" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5582" data-end=3D"5627" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5585" data-end=3D"5627">5. Avantages et Inconv=C3=A9nients de Redux</strong=
></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5628" data-end=3D"5645" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5632" data-end=3D"5645">Avantages</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5646" data-end=3D"5903" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-=
start=3D"5648" data-end=3D"5676">Centralisation de l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat</str=
ong> : Tout l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat est stock=C3=A9 dans un unique store.<br da=
ta-start=3D"5723" data-end=3D"5726">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"5728" data-end=3D"5747">D=C3=A9bogage facil=
e</strong> : Gr=C3=A2ce aux outils comme Redux DevTools.<br data-start=3D"5=
788" data-end=3D"5791">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"5793" data-end=3D"5808">Scalabilit=C3=A9</s=
trong> : Id=C3=A9al pour des applications complexes avec beaucoup de compos=
ants partageant un m=C3=AAme =C3=A9tat.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5905" data-end=3D"5926" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5909" data-end=3D"5926">Inconv=C3=A9nients</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5927" data-end=3D"6103" class=3D"">=E2=9D=8C <strong data-=
start=3D"5929" data-end=3D"5981">Complexit=C3=A9 inutile pour les petites a=
pplications</strong><br data-start=3D"5981" data-end=3D"5984">
=E2=9D=8C <strong data-start=3D"5986" data-end=3D"6007">Code plus verbeux</=
strong> : Plus de fichiers et de configurations n=C3=A9cessaires par rappor=
t =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"6074" data-end=3D"6084">useState</code> ou <co=
de data-start=3D"6088" data-end=3D"6100">useContext</code>.</p>
