<li data-start=3D"1396" data-end=3D"1431" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1398" data-end=3D"1431" class=3D"">Le suivi des actions di=
spatch=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1432" data-end=3D"1499" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1434" data-end=3D"1499" class=3D"">La visualisation de l'=
=C3=A9tat du store avant et apr=C3=A8s chaque action.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1500" data-end=3D"1602" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1502" data-end=3D"1602" class=3D"">La possibilit=C3=A9 de =
revenir dans le temps pour analyser les changements d'=C3=A9tat (fonction T=
ime Travel).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1603" data-end=3D"1705" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1605" data-end=3D"1705" class=3D"">L'int=C3=A9gration avec=
 des outils de d=C3=A9veloppement de navigateur comme <strong data-start=3D=
"1672" data-end=3D"1689">Google Chrome</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"16=
93" data-end=3D"1704">Firefox</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1707" data-end=3D"1821" class=3D"">Il permet de mieux comp=
rendre le flux des donn=C3=A9es dans une application Redux et facilite le p=
rocessus de d=C3=A9bogage.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1823" data-end=3D"1826" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1828" data-end=3D"1885" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1831" data-end=3D"1885">2. Installation et configuration de Redux DevTools<=
/strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1886" data-end=3D"1906" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1890" data-end=3D"1906">Installation</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1907" data-end=3D"2038" class=3D"">Si vous travaillez sur =
une application React avec Redux, l'installation de Redux DevTools peut se =
faire en quelques =C3=A9tapes simples.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"2040" data-end=3D"2076" class=3D"">1. <strong data-start=
=3D"2048" data-end=3D"2076">Installer Redux DevTools</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"2077" data-end=3D"2243" class=3D"">Pour les navigateurs, l=
'extension Redux DevTools est disponible pour <strong data-start=3D"2146" d=
ata-end=3D"2163">Google Chrome</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"2167" data=
-end=3D"2186">Mozilla Firefox</strong>. Installez l'extension en fonction d=
e votre navigateur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2244" data-end=3D"2437">
<li data-start=3D"2244" data-end=3D"2337" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2246" data-end=3D"2337" class=3D""><a data-start=3D"2246" =
data-end=3D"2337" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"cursor-pointer"=
>Redux DevTools Chrome Extension</a></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2338" data-end=3D"2437" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2340" data-end=3D"2437" class=3D""><a data-start=3D"2340" =
data-end=3D"2437" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"" href=3D"https=
://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/reduxdevtools/">Redux DevTools Fi=
refox Extension</a></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"2439" data-end=3D"2505" class=3D"">2. <strong data-start=
=3D"2447" data-end=3D"2505">Installer <code data-start=3D"2459" data-end=3D=
"2485">redux-devtools-extension</code> dans votre projet</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"2506" data-end=3D"2615" class=3D"">Pour int=C3=A9grer Redu=
x DevTools dans votre projet, vous devez installer le package <strong data-=
start=3D"2586" data-end=3D"2614">redux-devtools-extension</strong>.</p>
