<p data-start=3D"654" data-end=3D"711" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"654=
" data-end=3D"711">Comment le Virtual DOM am=C3=A9liore-t-il la performance=
 ?</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"715" data-end=3D"811">
<li data-start=3D"715" data-end=3D"743" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"717" data-end=3D"743" class=3D"">Minimisation des re-rendu=
s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"747" data-end=3D"780" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"749" data-end=3D"780" class=3D"">R=C3=A9duction des acc=C3=
=A8s DOM co=C3=BBteux</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"784" data-end=3D"811" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"786" data-end=3D"811" class=3D"">Batching des mises =C3=A0=
 jour</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"812" data-end=3D"874" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"815" data-end=3D"874" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"815=
" data-end=3D"874">Diff=C3=A9rences entre le Virtual DOM et le DOM traditio=
nnel</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"875" data-end=3D"977" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"878" data-end=3D"923" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"878=
" data-end=3D"923">Le processus de r=C3=A9conciliation dans React</strong><=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"927" data-end=3D"977">
<li data-start=3D"927" data-end=3D"977" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"929" data-end=3D"977" class=3D"">L'algorithme de comparais=
on des arbres (Diffing)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
